1
00:01:09,800 --> 00:01:11,060
Roujing, are you okay?

2
00:01:18,680 --> 00:01:19,480
I'm fine.

3
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:20,539
He just passed out.

4
00:01:20,720 --> 00:01:22,440
Good thing no one got killed.

5
00:01:22,520 --> 00:01:23,240
If I hadn't dared to come,

6
00:01:23,240 --> 00:01:24,880
you would have killed someone.

7
00:01:24,880 --> 00:01:25,560
With all this noise,

8
00:01:25,560 --> 00:01:27,090
why didn't anyone stop him?

9
00:01:27,320 --> 00:01:28,980
You know my husband's temper.

10
00:01:29,160 --> 00:01:30,920
Stopping him is provoking him.

11
00:01:30,920 --> 00:01:32,000
No one dares to.

12
00:01:32,240 --> 00:01:33,120
Zhangxin,

13
00:01:33,200 --> 00:01:35,880
you're the only one in this house
who dares to treat me well.

14
00:01:35,880 --> 00:01:36,960
Thank you.

15
00:01:37,360 --> 00:01:38,160
You need to leave now.

16
00:01:38,160 --> 00:01:39,160
Otherwise, when he wakes up,

17
00:01:39,160 --> 00:01:40,320
he won't let you off.

18
00:01:40,320 --> 00:01:41,560
-I'm not leaving.
-Go, now!

19
00:01:41,560 --> 00:01:42,920
With He Shizai's power in Rongcheng,

20
00:01:42,920 --> 00:01:44,850
I can't escape no matter where I go.

21
00:01:45,400 --> 00:01:46,800
Then I'll take you to Madam He

22
00:01:46,800 --> 00:01:48,060
and ask her to help you.

23
00:01:49,400 --> 00:01:50,860
Can you contact Master He?

24
00:01:50,880 --> 00:01:53,880
Dad never lets anyone disturb him
when he goes abroad.

25
00:01:54,120 --> 00:01:55,800
He only contacts Madam He.

26
00:01:56,080 --> 00:01:58,680
Looks like I can only wait
until Dad comes home.

27
00:01:58,960 --> 00:02:00,760
Let's go. We'll go find Madam He.

28
00:02:04,480 --> 00:02:05,280
Madam He.

29
00:02:05,520 --> 00:02:06,760
This isn't the first or second time

30
00:02:06,760 --> 00:02:08,160
the eldest young master
has domestically abused his wife.

31
00:02:08,160 --> 00:02:09,280
If this continues...

32
00:02:09,280 --> 00:02:11,740
It's bound to cause trouble
sooner or later.

33
00:02:12,280 --> 00:02:14,080
You called me here this late

34
00:02:14,320 --> 00:02:15,960
to tell me what to do?

35
00:02:16,280 --> 00:02:17,360
Madam He,

36
00:02:17,560 --> 00:02:19,560
Zhangxin is just looking out for me.

37
00:02:19,920 --> 00:02:21,480
Please don't blame her.

38
00:02:21,600 --> 00:02:24,040
The He family holds
a pivotal position in Rongcheng.

39
00:02:24,040 --> 00:02:24,960
Over the years,

40
00:02:25,240 --> 00:02:26,920
Master He has helped the poor and needy.

41
00:02:26,920 --> 00:02:28,320
He's not just an entrepreneur,

42
00:02:28,320 --> 00:02:30,160
but a beloved philanthropist.

43
00:02:30,440 --> 00:02:31,760
The He family has always
valued its reputation.

44
00:02:31,760 --> 00:02:33,490
Are you going to let everything

45
00:02:33,520 --> 00:02:34,680
Master He worked so hard for

46
00:02:34,680 --> 00:02:35,880
be ruined overnight?

47
00:02:40,920 --> 00:02:41,680
Come here.

48
00:02:56,240 --> 00:02:57,320
I know it's not easy for Mrs. He

49
00:02:57,320 --> 00:02:58,360
to manage the estate alone.

50
00:02:58,360 --> 00:03:00,240
But since you're Master He's better half,

51
00:03:00,240 --> 00:03:02,700
you should share his burden,
shouldn't you?

52
00:03:03,880 --> 00:03:05,560
Mrs. He,

53
00:03:05,560 --> 00:03:07,120
I'm sorry.

54
00:03:07,360 --> 00:03:08,760
We disturbed your sleep.

55
00:03:08,760 --> 00:03:10,020
We'll leave right now.

56
00:03:10,600 --> 00:03:11,480
Let's go.

57
00:03:41,640 --> 00:03:43,720
To think the eldest young master
of the He family

58
00:03:43,720 --> 00:03:45,840
was beaten by a servant.

59
00:03:50,280 --> 00:03:51,079
Does it hurt?

60
00:03:53,040 --> 00:03:55,280
Li Zhangxin really hits hard.

61
00:03:56,640 --> 00:03:58,840
I'd say it was a well-deserved beating.

62
00:03:59,360 --> 00:04:00,200
Ah!

63
00:04:02,600 --> 00:04:03,640
Do you think the Master doesn't know

64
00:04:03,640 --> 00:04:05,300
about the domestic violence?

65
00:04:05,640 --> 00:04:06,440
He's just turning

66
00:04:06,440 --> 00:04:08,120
a blind eye for now.

67
00:04:08,360 --> 00:04:09,720
Once it's exposed,

68
00:04:09,760 --> 00:04:10,960
will he let you off?

69
00:04:11,120 --> 00:04:12,760
It's all that bitch's fault.

70
00:04:13,520 --> 00:04:15,320
Just looking at her makes me mad.

71
00:04:21,160 --> 00:04:22,480
He Shi,

72
00:04:22,920 --> 00:04:25,360
stop causing trouble for me.

73
00:04:32,800 --> 00:04:34,800
Don't be angry.

74
00:04:41,000 --> 00:04:42,560
Let me help you

75
00:04:42,560 --> 00:04:44,240
cool down.

76
00:04:54,600 --> 00:04:55,600
In this house,

77
00:04:56,080 --> 00:04:57,760
I will always be Mrs. He.

78
00:04:57,760 --> 00:04:58,720
I'm warning you.

79
00:04:59,080 --> 00:05:00,610
No more domestic violence.

80
00:05:00,960 --> 00:05:02,360
If you must hit me,

81
00:05:02,640 --> 00:05:04,720
do it somewhere private.

82
00:05:17,360 --> 00:05:18,680
I'm sorry, Zhangxin.

83
00:05:19,320 --> 00:05:20,640
It's all my fault

84
00:05:20,720 --> 00:05:22,480
that you offended He Shi

85
00:05:22,880 --> 00:05:24,440
and Mrs. He.

86
00:05:27,040 --> 00:05:27,840
It's fine.

87
00:05:28,280 --> 00:05:29,560
I think Mrs. He

88
00:05:29,560 --> 00:05:31,240
has taken it to heart.

89
00:05:32,360 --> 00:05:33,880
Haven't you ever thought about a divorce?

90
00:05:33,880 --> 00:05:35,140
Before we got married,

91
00:05:35,600 --> 00:05:37,000
He Shi made me sign

92
00:05:37,000 --> 00:05:38,640
a strict prenup.

93
00:05:39,159 --> 00:05:40,480
If we divorce,

94
00:05:40,480 --> 00:05:41,840
I leave with nothing.

95
00:05:43,760 --> 00:05:45,040
Then

96
00:05:45,040 --> 00:05:47,040
I wouldn't even be able to keep

97
00:05:47,760 --> 00:05:49,120
my baby.

98
00:05:49,120 --> 00:05:51,000
Don't go back tonight.

99
00:05:51,480 --> 00:05:52,880
If He Shi wakes up,

100
00:05:52,880 --> 00:05:55,140
he'll definitely keep coming after you.

101
00:05:55,240 --> 00:05:57,040
If you don't mind,

102
00:05:57,560 --> 00:05:59,080
you can stay here.

103
00:06:10,920 --> 00:06:14,520
The family motto echoes
with a lasting charm,

104
00:06:14,680 --> 00:06:18,440
the earnest words in the hall linger on.

105
00:06:18,680 --> 00:06:22,400
The love between parents
and children is like a net,

106
00:06:22,600 --> 00:06:25,880
the respect among brothers
is like flying geese.

107
00:06:36,840 --> 00:06:39,600
Let me admire my beautiful self.

108
00:06:46,280 --> 00:06:47,080
Not bad.

109
00:07:05,400 --> 00:07:07,200
Ah, Li Zhangxin,

110
00:07:07,480 --> 00:07:09,480
it was you.

111
00:08:01,240 --> 00:08:02,520
You're awake.

112
00:08:06,360 --> 00:08:08,160
Did I see it wrong?

113
00:08:10,800 --> 00:08:11,560
Li Zhangxin!

114
00:08:11,840 --> 00:08:13,400
The butler said
a batch of frozen goods arrived

115
00:08:13,400 --> 00:08:14,930
and asked you to check them.

116
00:08:55,760 --> 00:08:56,560
Open the door!

117
00:08:57,160 --> 00:08:58,090
Is anyone there?

118
00:09:00,040 --> 00:09:01,770
Open the door! Is anyone there?

119
00:09:03,360 --> 00:09:05,090
Is anyone there? Open the door!

120
00:09:05,520 --> 00:09:06,440
Open the door!

121
00:09:07,160 --> 00:09:08,520
Open up!

122
00:09:09,120 --> 00:09:10,600
Open the door!

123
00:09:10,800 --> 00:09:11,760
Open the door!

124
00:09:13,320 --> 00:09:14,880
Is anyone there?
